sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Guard as 👮 Security Staff
  participant Route as FastAPI Route<br/>(POST /packages)
  participant Intake as PackageIntakeService
  participant UoW as MongoUnitOfWork
  participant PkgRepo as MongoPackageRepository
  participant IncRepo as MongoIncidentRepository
  participant Trans as PackageTransitioner
  participant Bus as EventBus
  participant Notif as NotificationDispatcher

  Guard->>Route: POST /api/v1/packages {courier, tracking_id, recipient_id, size, condition}
  Route->>Route: Validate payload (Pydantic: no future arrival, damage notes if damaged)
  Route->>Intake: register(data, staff, idempotency_key)
  Intake->>UoW: packages.find_by_tracking_id(normalised_tracking_id)
  alt Duplicate Tracking ID Exists
    Intake->>UoW: audit.add("package.duplicate_rejected", details)
    Intake->>UoW: commit()
    Route-->>Guard: 409 Conflict (DUPLICATE_TRACKING_ID, returns existing package code)
  else Unique Tracking ID
    Intake->>UoW: users.get_by_institutional_id(recipient_id)
    alt Learner Not Found & Hint Provided
      Intake->>Intake: Set status = UNIDENTIFIED, create auto INCIDENT
    else Damaged On Arrival
      Intake->>Intake: Set status = DAMAGED, create auto INCIDENT
    else Recipient Active & Good Condition
      Intake->>Intake: Set status = VERIFIED
    end
    Intake->>PkgRepo: create(package_doc) -> generates internal_code PKG-yymmdd-XXXXX
    Intake->>Trans: record initial history & audit log
    Intake->>UoW: commit() (atomic write of package, history, incident, audit)
    UoW->>Bus: publish PackageStatusChanged (VERIFIED / DAMAGED)
    Bus->>Notif: handle(event) -> queue in-app notification for learner
    Route-->>Guard: 201 Created {package details, internal_code, status}
  end
